       Do not "tidy" it back under the footer's root — a fixed
       element inside a transformed ancestor stops being fixed to
       the viewport, and Elementor motion effects can add a
       transform at any time.
     • The trigger's href is a real mailto, not "#", so the item
       still does something useful before the script runs.
